    "diagnosis": "<p>Pleomorphic adenoma</p>",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>Pleomorphic adenoma is composed of glands surrounded by epithelial cells, with a thin rim of myoepithelial cells. Single stellate cells are dispersed in the stroma.</p>",
